t yes, I would hope that it's not reproducable in versions that feature the normal per-pixel shading but it's nice that you confirmed it :+1:\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2432168835/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2432952197","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98440#issuecomment-2432952197","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98440","id":2432952197,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RA-eF","user":{"login":"Momonyaro","id":58791263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkxMjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58791263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Momonyaro","html_url":"https://github.com/Momonyaro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Momonyaro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Momonyaro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Momonyaro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Momonyaro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Momonyaro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Momonyaro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Momonyaro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Momonyaro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Momonyaro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-23T17:30:41Z","updated_at":"2024-10-23T19:45:40Z","body":"Alright, final post from me here for a while until someone starts taking a peek.\r\n\r\nI've tried the example project on three separate computers. My linux PC, a MacBook Pro 2019 from work and one of my friends windows 10 stationary PC.\r\n\r\nAll three computers experienced the bug at more than one of the resolutions featured in the example project.\r\nI will list the resolutions below and tag what computer experienced the issue for each.\r\n\r\n* 2560x1440 (MacBook Pro, Linux PC)\r\n* 1440x1080 (Linux PC [The right edge this time? was using windowed mode])\r\n* 1280x1024 (MacBook Pro, Linux PC, Windows 10 PC)\r\n* 1366x768   (MacBook Pro, Linux PC, Windows 10 PC)\r\n* 1280x768   (MacBook Pro, Linux PC, Windows 10 PC)\r\n* 1024x768   (MacBook Pro, Linux PC, Windows 10 PC)\r\n\r\nNow it's interesting to note that 2560x1440 did not have the issue when testing on the Windows 10 PC. I do not know what the cause of that could be except a suspicion that it's because his monitors are 1920x1080 compared to the two other computers that had screen resolutions of 2560x1440.\r\n\r\nAll the computers tried running the example project both from the editor and from a exported version. The resolutions were consistent between versions.\r\n\r\nI hope someone can get some useful info from all this rambling (sorry if I seemed impatient but I lost a good bit of sleep due to this issue). Please reach out if you need any more information and I'll happily lend a hand.\r\n\r\nHappy Hunting!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2432952197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461100418","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98440#issuecomment-2461100418","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98440","id":2461100418,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SsWmC","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","